---
description: Prepare one prepareDeliberation evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CivicPortfolio[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Produce accessible comparisons, maps or structured location views, and clear decision procedures. Preserve proposer corrections, record the authorized community decision, and transfer selected projects into accountable delivery plans with explicit acceptance criteria. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
